{
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The governing distance is the trace, not the rider's recollection: gps_trace.trace_distance_km is 51.86 km against a booked optimal of 38.1 km, an excess of 13.76 km (36.1%) - not the 'fifty kilometres somehow became seventy' the claim pleads. POL-RD-01 fixes gps_trace.trace_distance_km as the governing field and expressly bars trip_record.actual_distance_km from the threshold test, so the excess this tribunal can act on is 13.76 km and no more.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-00513", "EV-TRIP-00513"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_km",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever is made of the route, the money is bounded by POL-RD-02's arithmetic: recomputed_fare = (3.80 base + 0.75 x 38.1 optimal km + 0.28 x 42.0 optimal min) x 1.0 surge, read from fare_breakdown.surge_multiplier and not from any other artifact, + 0.80 platform fee + 0.00 ERP and tolls + 0.00 fixed surcharge + 0.00 waiting time - 0.00 promo = SGD 44.935. Refund = charged_total 58.09 - 44.935 = SGD 13.155, rounded up to SGD 13.20. That is 22.6% of charged_total, well below the 90% full-refund share, so the ceiling on this claim is a SGD 13.20 partial, not the SGD 58.09 demanded.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00513", "EV-TRIP-00513"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.refund.payable",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "POL-RD-06 is engaged because the excess is material (13.76 km, above the 8.0 km absolute limb), and it returns a clean profile: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0, below the 3-flag trigger, and 0 divided by 250 driver_profile.completed_trips_90d is 0.00, below the 0.05 ratio. No repeat-deviation pattern is established, so there is no FULL_REFUND uplift on the remedy and no POL-RD-06(c) conduct referral; POL-GEN-01 permits only those two counters to be used for this test, and the driver's other profile fields are context only.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-00513"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The driver's contemporaneous account is corroborated in place and time rather than invented: advisory ADV-20261413-001 records slow traffic on MCE westbound near Marina, active 06:16-08:16 and overlapping this trip (06:46-07:38) by 52 minutes, which matches his statement that a jam near Marina produced a re-route. It does not, however, carry an exoneration: the same artifact records intersects_route = false and carries no shortest_lawful_alternative_km, so POL-RD-03's limb (a) is not met and its cap formula cannot be run, and under POL-RD-08 the driver's burden to invoke an exculpatory clause is not discharged on this record. The driver does not ask the tribunal to excuse the excess on this material; he asks it to fix the figure on the remaining clauses.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-00513-01"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-03", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": "intersects_route",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "There is nothing to add on pass-through lines: the fare_breakdown itemises no ERP gantry (tolls_erp 0.00, erp_gantries empty) and no airport surcharge (airport_surcharge 0.00, which is correct because this trip ENDS at Changi rather than originating there, so no surcharge is chargeable). POL-RD-09 therefore has no off-route or phantom line to correct and adds nothing beyond the POL-RD-02 figure.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-00513"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.components.fixed_surcharges",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider's account of what happened in the car - the driver going 'very warm' and asking which country she was flying to - is supported by no artifact in the bundle: the trip's in-app chat log carries 0 messages, no waypoint hint and no named road or place. Under POL-RD-08 an assertion that cites no evidence ID carries no weight and is discarded, so that narrative cannot enlarge the claim beyond the distance-and-time arithmetic.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-00513"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-08"],
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}
